title: ShopDoor
---
// Talk target of the corner shop's door (Hotspots layer), a separate area of the map reached
// from the stairs on the landing (stairs_landing.yarn). Taking something is buying it.
-> Go back up
    <<if $item_wine_fox or $item_wine_reserve or $item_wine_house or $item_tulips or $item_chocolates>>
        You: Money on the counter. Back up.
    <<endif>>
    <<fade_out>>
    <<place Player PlayerFromShop>>
    <<face Player right>>
    <<fade_in>>
===
